    narr:narration """The narrative turns on a demand-based split of the ferry timetable: [the weekday last ferry moves earlier to 21:55 from November, after late sailings carried under ten passengers a night](narr:Expr_20261009_4_Batch4FerryFrontmatter20261009041528_hf592dd2b25e2_1), while [the weekend timetable stays untouched because Friday and Saturday late sailings still fill](narr:Expr_20261009_4_Batch4FerryFrontmatter20261009041528_hf592dd2b25e2_2). Both children are framed as decisions grounded in ridership evidence rather than preference.""" ;
